OL,3,GNEWSA'Unsurvivable' punch killed pub
OL,4,Aboss, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pub boss died after an "unsurvivable"
OL,7,Fpunch to the neck, a court has heard.
OL,9,FMatthew O'Gara, who ran The Plough pub
OL,10,Fin Huddlesford, Staffordshire, died in
OL,11,Fhospital two days after the incident at
OL,12,Fthe Ricco and Loren bar on Market
OL,13,FStreet, Lichfield, on 24 May.
OL,15,FBilly Allison, 36, who has admitted
OL,16,Fmanslaughter, delivered a "very, very
OL,17,Fhard" punch with the "stance and skill
OL,18,Fof an experienced fighter", the jury
OL,19,Fwas told. A trial over a murder charge
OL,20,Fagainst him opened at Stafford Crown
OL,21,FCourt earlier.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
